WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.488
Day 8. The Last Letter, and the Look-Alikes.

2
00:00:02.938 --> 00:00:09.750
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:14.868
First, the last new letter. It is at the top of the page, with its animal friend.

4
00:00:15.318 --> 00:00:21.593
Now the look-alikes. Your child knows both letters of each pair now, so today they go side by side.

5
00:00:22.193 --> 00:00:28.328
Put the pair in front of your child. Ask which is which. Then trace each one with a finger and say its name.

6
00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:36.566
Job one: you say one letter for each box, in the order printed in the yellow box. Your child circles the one you said.

7
00:00:37.016 --> 00:00:41.461
Job two: find and circle, a row for each letter of the first pair.
